OL,3,GNEWSAFirst wild beavers born in county
OL,4,Ain over 500 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA beaver that moved into a nature
OL,7,Freserve has given birth to the first
OL,8,Fkits born wild in a county for 500
OL,9,Fyears, according to the park.
OL,11,FBeavers became extinct in Britain in
OL,12,Fthe 16th Century due to overhunting,
OL,13,Fbut in November, Pensthorpe Natural
OL,14,FPark in Fakenham, Norfolk, became home
OL,15,Fto one beaver - thought to be solitary
OL,16,F- which was understood to be the first
OL,17,Fwild beaver in the county for 500
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
