OL,3,GNEWSAFirst wild beavers born in county
OL,4,Ain over 500 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, camera trap footage in the
OL,7,Fbeaver's lodge later revealed two
OL,8,Fbeavers living together, followed by
OL,9,Fthe two kits.
OL,11,FThe park described the arrival of the
OL,12,Fbabies as "an extraordinary moment".
